WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.670
Pricing & MOQ: price tiers (say, distributor or contractor), quantity breaks, minimum orders and wholesale settings.

2
00:00:11.218 --> 00:00:17.250
Under "Price tiers", create a tier with "New tier" and set a "off" or fixed price.

3
00:00:17.795 --> 00:00:22.620
For a quantity break, click "Add rule" and set "From qty".

4
00:00:23.171 --> 00:00:29.360
Under "Minimum order quantities", set each item's or category's minimum with "New rule".

5
00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:34.420
A tier that companies use isn't deleted, only deactivated.
